{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"63f8f0f076f9002b","x":-578,"y":137,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3","type":"text","text":"Torrie"},
		{"id":"7f822d3e6fe92847","x":-220,"y":137,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"Eddie"},
		{"id":"05484c3d347da46c","x":520,"y":137,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"6","type":"text","text":"Mrs. Welton"},
		{"id":"217bf39ad4dce615","x":860,"y":137,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"2","type":"text","text":"Mrs. Oliver"},
		{"id":"1a164c988fbed7cf","x":160,"y":137,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"5","type":"text","text":"Mr. Charleston"},
		{"id":"147c66a505fad600","x":-577,"y":241,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Character : Brash, naive, optimistic"},
		{"id":"208765178f46e229","type":"text","text":"Character : Dry, Down to Earth, smart.","x":-219,"y":241,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"37d00ac12e7c7c52","type":"text","text":"Goal : To be done as quick as possible","x":-220,"y":301,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"17a83b6455d8bbe3","type":"text","text":"Character : Stern","x":161,"y":241,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"a51861ca8b2b7f4b","type":"text","text":"Goal : To mediate between Mrs. Welton and Mrs. Oliver","x":160,"y":301,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"1f7ad6fa1a9ae5f2","type":"text","text":"Obstacle : Torrie and Mrs. Oliver","x":160,"y":361,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"11f31b2abe618cca","type":"text","text":"Character : Calm, Wise, ","x":521,"y":241,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4cb04387b1a76cdd","type":"text","text":"Goal : To get her daughter","x":520,"y":301,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9b9cc79d01739472","type":"text","text":"Obstacle : Torrie","x":520,"y":361,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7aaaa0361e366e5d","type":"text","text":"Character : Bigoted, Angry","x":861,"y":241,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c4506a2588d95edd","type":"text","text":"Goal : ","x":860,"y":301,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2db22e8f933294f5","type":"text","text":"Obstacle :","x":860,"y":361,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c46e906483d116e6","x":-219,"y":-220,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Scene"},
		{"id":"8a8a3708ce51aa6b","type":"text","text":"Purpose : ","x":-219,"y":-160,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"c495f8517ea6a334","x":-577,"y":301,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Goal : To proof her innocence."},
		{"id":"e2c106525af571e2","x":-577,"y":361,"width":250,"height":79,"type":"text","text":"Obstacle  Mrs Oliver's accusation and Mr Charleston's suspicion"},
		{"id":"ad82d757644c470c","type":"text","text":"Obstacle : Mr. Charleston","x":-220,"y":361,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"21690a85ac61c297","x":1560,"y":-148,"width":667,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"**The office:** When they arrive, the student(s), parents, and sometimes teachers or counselors are present. The headmaster or vice-principal usually leads the session."},
		{"id":"33c30baf48c17f58","x":1788,"y":-240,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"1. **Setting the Stage**"},
		{"id":"7fa1cd2069c655e9","x":1560,"y":-60,"width":667,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"**Tone:** It’s formal but designed to de-escalate. The headmaster makes clear that the goal is understanding and resolution, not just punishment."},
		{"id":"4cc20a988621f5ae","x":1788,"y":54,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"2. **Fact-Finding**"},
		{"id":"7d84477d1254379a","x":1560,"y":135,"width":667,"height":64,"type":"text","text":"The headmaster outlines **what happened** based on reports (teachers, witnesses, CCTV)."},
		{"id":"ec2a916a901140be","x":1560,"y":241,"width":667,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Each student is asked to explain their side. Parents sometimes speak up, defending or clarifying."},
		{"id":"17805e99c192ef55","x":1560,"y":331,"width":667,"height":53,"type":"text","text":"The staff works to establish the **root cause**: bullying, rivalry, personal insults, misunderstanding, or ongoing tension."},
		{"id":"6b7e6487aa50aa1c","type":"text","text":"Sometimes the students are guided into a structured apology.","x":1560,"y":1281,"width":667,"height":53},
		{"id":"0246d6ee9e9d72eb","type":"text","text":"The headmaster emphasizes that fighting is unacceptable, but also encourages reconciliation.","x":1560,"y":1361,"width":667,"height":53},
		{"id":"9b4b3ad223eb6ad5","type":"text","text":"In strong cases, a written agreement or behavior contract is made, signed by both students and parents.","x":1560,"y":1441,"width":667,"height":60},
		{"id":"38365e6e5a9457d4","type":"text","text":"The school might involve a counselor if there’s emotional/psychological tension.","x":1560,"y":1641,"width":667,"height":53},
		{"id":"d52981dde92e5c0b","type":"text","text":"Parents may be asked to keep an eye on behavior at home.","x":1560,"y":1721,"width":667,"height":53},
		{"id":"e87ba3a7844096ea","type":"text","text":"The headmaster usually ends with a reminder: “We want what’s best for both of you — education and safety come first.”","x":1560,"y":1801,"width":667,"height":60},
		{"id":"ae1609e1a78871b7","type":"text","text":"5. **Resolution / Mediation**","x":1788,"y":1181,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"82cd9b0bda2c9dfd","type":"text","text":"6. **Follow-Up**","x":1788,"y":1541,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"73bbd029056f9e1a","type":"text","text":"If one party was clearly the aggressor, the headmaster will emphasize accountability, but both are usually urged to reflect on better ways to handle conflict.","x":1560,"y":661,"width":667,"height":60},
		{"id":"ab6b226c8e4de5e0","type":"text","text":"Depending on the severity: verbal warning, detention, suspension, loss of privileges, or probation.","x":1560,"y":881,"width":667,"height":53},
		{"id":"474ffd584adbc9d3","type":"text","text":"For repeat offenders, consequences escalate.","x":1560,"y":961,"width":667,"height":53},
		{"id":"a774a79b07432ee9","type":"text","text":"Parents are made aware of the school’s policy and what happens next if the behavior continues.","x":1560,"y":1041,"width":667,"height":60},
		{"id":"0ea3ae0730365f38","x":1788,"y":781,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"4. **Disciplinary Measures**"},
		{"id":"6f48d01c452a13cc","x":1788,"y":421,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"3. **Responsibility & Reflection**"},
		{"id":"f3a93b6ffb38a26f","type":"text","text":"Students are encouraged (sometimes pressured) to acknowledge their role.","x":1560,"y":501,"width":667,"height":53},
		{"id":"7a0a3bce2dcfdcb9","type":"text","text":"Parents may be asked if they were aware of any ongoing issues.","x":1560,"y":581,"width":667,"height":53},
		{"id":"f4bee6d1a8174641","x":-900,"y":540,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Torrie will end up getting a probation"},
		{"id":"5233821ca767c669","x":-1039,"y":-221,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"1. "},
		{"id":"b14993f8d049661e","x":-1039,"y":-161,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"2. "},
		{"id":"c4868b9e2f242051","x":-1039,"y":-101,"width":250,"height":58,"type":"text","text":"3. "},
		{"id":"126807081dc897e3","x":-1039,"y":-43,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"4. "},
		{"id":"c9726359dfc7c5e3","x":-1040,"y":17,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"5. "},
